menu "StackChan firmware"

config STACKCHAN_PROTOCOL_TESTS
    bool "Build protocol Unity tests"
    default n
    help
        Enables the on-target Unity test menu for device protocol validation.
        This option is for test builds only and does not initialize device hardware.

config STACKCHAN_LAN_TEST_CERT
    bool "Trust an embedded LAN test certificate"
    default n
    help
        Enables only the local LAN test profile. The profile trusts the
        ignored lan-test-server.pem file instead of the public certificate
        bundle. Do not enable this for a production firmware image.

config STACKCHAN_LAN_HTTP_MODE
    bool "Allow private-IPv4 HTTP/WS development transport"
    default n
    help
        Enables a separate development firmware that accepts only literal
        private IPv4 HTTP origins and uses plain TCP transport. Never enable
        this option for a production firmware image.

config STACKCHAN_SCREENSAVER_IDLE_SECONDS
    int "Idle seconds before the local screensaver"
    range 30 3600
    default 300
    help
        Lowers the CoreS3 display brightness after this period and moves only
        the two small pupil regions at a low refresh rate. Touch, voice
        activity, and reminders restore the normal face and brightness.

config STACKCHAN_WAKE_WORD_MODEL
    string "Preferred WakeNet model name"
    default "wn9l_histackchan_tts3"
    help
        Selects one exact WakeNet model already packaged in the model
        partition. Custom text alone cannot create a WakeNet model. Add a
        generated model through ESP_SR_EXTERNAL_MODEL_PATH, set its directory
        name here, and keep wn9l_histackchan_tts3 compiled as the safe fallback.

endmenu
